<title>USA: EPL Technologies Inc Q1 net loss increases.</title>
<headline>EPL Technologies Inc Q1 net loss increases.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>THREE MONTHS ENDED MARCH 31,</p>
<p>					  1997		 1996</p>
<p> Sales			  $3,788,724	  $1,697,528</p>
<p> Net Loss		   ( 1,391,072)	  ( 934,553)</p>
<p>Net Loss per</p>
<p>  Common Share		   ( 0.10)	     ( 0.08)</p>
<p>Weighted Average Number</p>
<p>of Common Shares</p>
<p>  Outstanding		 15,572,867	  13,310,552</p>
<p>NOTE:  Net income for the first quarter of 1997 includes one-time relocation and plant reorganization subsequent to the acquisition of EPL Flexible.</p>
<p>Net income was calculated before the payment of preferred dividends of $124,350 and $71,294 in the first quarter ended March 31, 1997 and 1996, respectively; earnings per share were calculated after the payment of preferred dividends.</p>
